---
title: "oauth_consent_code_generation (stem-system: Clubhouse Manager)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_receive_consent: user submits consent form (POST)
    q_receive_consent --> q_check_auth: validate user session
    q_check_auth --> q_error_unauth: user not authenticated
    q_check_auth --> q_generate_code: user authenticated
    q_error_unauth --> [*]: return 401
    q_generate_code --> q_store_code: generate authorization_code, store in DB with client_id, user_id, redirect_uri, code_challenge, scope, expiry
    q_store_code --> q_record_consent: save user consent for this application
    q_record_consent --> q_build_redirect: construct redirect_uri with code and state params
    q_build_redirect --> [*]: redirect to redirect_uri?code=xxx&state=yyy

    note right of q_generate_code
        INV-001: authorization code must be cryptographically random
        INV-002: authorization code expires after 10 minutes
        INV-003: code_challenge is stored with the code for later PKCE verification
    end note

    note right of q_record_consent
        INV-004: consent is recorded per (user_id, client_id) pair
        INV-005: previously consented users may skip consent screen on re-authorization
    end note
